  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given functional equation is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>m</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>6</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>in&#160;equation</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn></math></p>",
